{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mota of Latex - The Fallen Journey of a Mother and Daughter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor of the tower is filled with temptation and danger\uff0cThe latex and tentacle creatures within try to assimilate them into eternal slaves\uff0cThe mother and daughter must rely on each other\uff0cbut as their corruption increases\uff0ctheir wills begin to crumble\uff0cand they may even turn against one another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/CG-2.gif?t=1745046583\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic Tower (Roguelike Tower Adventure)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will explore a multi-layered otherworldly demon tower\uff0cwhere each floor features procedurally generated rooms\uff0cenemies and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/2025-03-20_14-22-13.gif?t=1745046583\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equipment System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Latex outfits and tentacle-related items serve as both gear and tools of discipline\uff0c enhancing attributes while increasing corruption levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569710/extras/2025-03-20_14-33-17_1.gif?t=1745046583\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Random Events</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor contains tentacle traps\uff0clatex-sealed chambers, or NPC temptations that influence character status and story progression.</p></li><